[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0626","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57901","title":"Linux Linux内核 af_packet模块MSG_PEEK处理不当导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 af_packet 模块存在一个漏洞，源于 vlan_get_protocol_dgram() 函数在处理 IPv6 报文时未能正确处理 MSG_PEEK 操作。当攻击者向目标系统发送精心构造的 IPv6 报文时，该函数会因网络缓冲区管理不当而崩溃，导致内核 panic。这种漏洞可以远程触发，无需身份验证，可能导致系统崩溃和权限提升。受影响的 Linux 内核版本使用 af_packet 模块进行数据包捕获，特别是在处理 IPv6 流量时使用自定义的 socket 操作。该漏洞的根源在于函数在 MSG_PEEK 条件下无法安全管理报文缓冲区，导致内存访问失控并触发内核 BUG。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57901"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：Linux 6.13-rc4 及后续稳定版（含修复提交 af_packet: fix vlan_get_protocol_dgram() vs MSG_PEEK）。各发行版修复版本：Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-5.10.234-1 或更高（DLA-4075-1）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-53-generic 或更高（USN-7381-1）；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-131-generic 或更高（USN-7459-1）；RHEL/CentOS 等待 RHSA-2025 补丁。暂无法升级内核时，可通过禁用 af_packet 模块（`modprobe -r af_packet` 并加入 blacklist）或限制本地非特权用户访问 AF_PACKET 套接字（`sysctl -w net.packet.enable=0`）作为临时缓解措施，但会影响抓包工具（如 tcpdump）功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0d3fa6c3c9ca7aa255696150f5b759ac4a4974e1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/560cbdd26b510626f3f4f27d34c44dfd3dd3499d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5d336714db324bef84490c75dcc48b387ef0346e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a693b87692b4d7c50f4fc08a996678d60534a9da","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd8488fdc7116f6da277515647b167859d4f72b1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de4f8d477c67ec1d7c28f3486c3e47d147d90a01","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f91a5b8089389eb408501af2762f168c3aaa7b79","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-398330.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57901.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57901.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57901","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57901.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57901.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57901.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57901.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57901-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-j9xh-8839-85hc/GHSA-j9xh-8839-85hc.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57901"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0626.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0625","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0625.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57900","title":"Linux 内核 ila 网络钩子序列化漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ILA (Identifier-Locator Addressing) IPv6 模块中存在竞争条件漏洞，源于 `ila_add_mapping()` 函数在处理并发 `ILA_CMD_ADD` 命令时，未对 `nf_register_net_hooks()` 调用进行同步保护。syzbot 发现并发执行时会导致 `nf_register_net_hooks()` 重复注册 netfilter 钩子，引发 rhashtable 哈希表的 use-after-free（释放后使用）漏洞。攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过并发发送 `ILA_CMD_ADD` 命令触发竞争条件，在 IPv6 数据包处理流程（`ipv6_rcv` -> `nf_hook_slow` -> `ila_nf_input` -> `ila_xlat_addr` -> `ila_lookup_wildcards` -> `rhashtable_lookup_fast`）中触发 KASAN 检测到的 slab-use-after-free 读取越界。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13-rc4 及相关版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量本地、低复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互，可导致高机密性/完整性/可用性影响。Linux 内核已通过引入互斥锁序列化 `nf_register_net_hooks()` 调用修复该漏洞（commit 031ae72825ce 尝试修复类似问题，后续补丁补充 mutex 保护）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57900"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13.0-rc4 或更高版本（包含修复提交 031ae72825ce 及后续 mutex 串行化补丁），或应用各发行版回港补丁：Ubuntu 24.04 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 及以上（USN-7381-1），Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-6.1.123-1 及以上（DLA-4075-1），RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux 9 升级至 kernel-5.14.0-503.11.1.el9_5 及以上，SLES 15 SP6 Azure 内核升级至 kernel-azure-6.4.0-150600.9.9.1 及以上（SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1）。若暂无法升级内核，可临时禁用 ILA 模块：echo \"blacklist ila\" > /etc/modprobe.d/ila-blacklist.conf 并执行 update-initramfs -u 后重启，或在防火墙层面禁止 IPv6 ILA 流量作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1638f430f8900f2375f5de45508fbe553997e190","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/17e8fa894345e8d2c7a7642482267b275c3d4553","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/260466b576bca0081a7d4acecc8e93687aa22d0e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d1b63cf468e446b9feaf4e4e73182b9cc82f460","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad0677c37c14fa28913daea92d139644d7acf04e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d3017895e393536b234cf80a83fc463c08a28137","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eba25e21dce7ec70e2b3f121b2f3a25a4ec43eca","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57900.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57900.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57900","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57900.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57900.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57900.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57900-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57900.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57900-ila-serialize-calls-to-nf-register--1771410250000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-v298-p3h5-pc6r/GHSA-v298-p3h5-pc6r.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0625.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0625.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0624","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0624.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57899","title":"Linux Kernel WiFi mac80211 子系统 32位系统整数溢出导致内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mac80211 WiFi 子系统在 32 位系统上存在 mbss 变更标志位损坏漏洞。由于 32 位系统上 unsigned long 为 4 字节而 u64 为 8 字节，在使用 or_each_set_bit 遍历位时，代码错误地按 32 位变量大小搜索本应为 64 位的位图，导致位查找错误，进而引发内核溢出崩溃。漏洞影响运行 mac80211 网状网络功能的 32 位 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，无需用户交互即可触发 ieee80211_link_info_change_notify 路径（经由网状网络工作队列触发），导致内核崩溃造成拒绝服务，CVSS 7.8 高危。Linux 内核已通过调整 bits 变量大小以适配架构修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57899"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到包含45173或更高版本（其中修复了 mac80211 32位系统位标志损坏问题），或应用 [内核补丁](https://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v6.x/patch-6.10.8.patch) 修复位大小处理错误。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 Wireless MAC 模块或配置 net.core.rmem_max=262144，以减小影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36b739637d7042843f9df57212ecee6ed6e0d4b2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/49dba1ded8dd5a6a12748631403240b2ab245c34","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86772872f9f5097cd03d0e1c6813238bd38c250b","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57899.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57899.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57899","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57899.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57899.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57899.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57899.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g55c-36vw-j7gr/GHSA-g55c-36vw-j7gr.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57899","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-68576.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0624.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0623","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0623.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57898","title":"Linux kernel cfg80211 链接删除时位图清理顺序错误导致内核警告漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 WiFi 子系统 cfg80211 模块存在链接 ID 位图管理逻辑错误，在链接删除过程中过早从 valid_links 位图清除链接 ID，导致后续清理操作（如 cfg80211_cac_event()）因找不到有效链接 ID 而触发内核 WARN_ON() 警告。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 WiFi 子系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限且无需用户交互，通过触发特定链接删除操作可触发内核警告导致系统完整性受到低度影响（CVSS 3.3 LOW，AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N）。Linux 内核已修复该逻辑顺序问题，将链接 ID 清除移至清理操作完成之后。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57898"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.75、6.10.14、6.11.3 或更高版本（包含提交 8d5a7b3e1f2c \"wifi: cfg80211: clear link ID from bitmap during link delete after clean up\" 的版本）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic (6.8.0-52.52) 或更新版本；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7514-1 提供的 linux-image-6.8.0-1006-oem (6.8.0-1006.6) 或更新版本。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时禁用不使用的 Wi-Fi 接口或限制本地用户对 nl80211 netlink 接口的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae07daf440d3220d0986e676317a5da66e4f9dfd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b5c32ff6a3a38c74facdd1fe34c0d709a55527fd","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57898.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57898.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57898.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57898","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57898.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57898.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57898.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57898.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57898-wifi-cfg80211-clear-link-id-from-bi-1767883848000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9w4x-56rq-p7vj/GHSA-9w4x-56rq-p7vj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0623.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0622","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0622.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57896","title":"Linux Kernel Btrfs 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在卸载（unmount）过程中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。在 close_ctree() 卸载路径中，内核先通过 kthread_stop() 停止 cleaner 内核线程并释放其 task_struct，随后才停止并销毁 delalloc 工作队列。然而 delalloc_workers 队列中的 worker 可能仍在执行 submit_compressed_extents() 函数，该函数调用 btrfs_add_delayed_iput() 时会尝试唤醒已被销毁的 cleaner 内核线程，导致对已释放 task_struct 的访问，引发内核崩溃或潜在权限提升。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可触发此漏洞，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57896"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：6.13 及以上、6.12.9、6.6.70、6.1.124、5.15.176 或 5.10.233。Debian 用户请更新至 DLA-4075-1 对应内核版本；Ubuntu 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在卸载 btrfs 文件系统前确保所有 delalloc 工作队列已排空完毕，避免触发释放后使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1ea629e7bb2fb40555e5e01a1b5095df31287017","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/35916b2f96505a18dc7242a115611b718d9de725","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/63f4b594a688bf922e8691f0784679aa7af7988c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2718ed1eb8c3611b63f8933c7e68c8821fe2808","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d77a3a99b53d12c061c007cdc96df38825dee476","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f10bef73fb355e3fc85e63a50386798be68ff486","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57896.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57896.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57896","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57896.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57896.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57896.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57896.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57896-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57896-btrfs-flush-delalloc-workers-queue--1771410125000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-w28c-hqg3-44gm/GHSA-w28c-hqg3-44gm.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0622.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0621","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0621.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57895","title":"Linux Kernel ksmbd 文件时间属性设置不当导致内核警告漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ksmbd（SMB/CIFS 协议实现）在通过 notify_change 修改文件 mtime 时未同时设置 ATTR_CTIME 标志，导致 setattr_copy_mgtime 触发内核警告并可能造成系统崩溃。本地已认证攻击者可通过 SMB2 协议发送特制的 set info 请求修改文件时间戳来触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13-rc1 及之后版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57895"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至修复版本：稳定分支升级到 6.6.70+、6.12.9+ 或 6.13+；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户安装 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1 及以上版本（对应 USN-7381-1）。如无法立即重启，可临时禁用 ksmbd 内核模块（执行 `sudo modprobe -r ksmbd` 并加入黑名单 `/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-ksmbd.conf`），或通过防火墙限制 SMB 端口（445/tcp）的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1d7ee876b8b96efc14e177a7fe8d45ac25d68849","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/21e46a79bbe6c4e1aa73b3ed998130f2ff07b128","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/52cefcff6a4a814f4f8e357422fcfb71fd2ebf75","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c7ab587bd33ce45e2aa6b6d2d36be7ef0bd16614","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57895.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57895.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57895","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57895.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57895.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57895.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57895.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-gvh3-4cff-qfpj/GHSA-gvh3-4cff-qfpj.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57895","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-57895.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0621.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0620","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57893","title":"Linux Kernel ALSA OSS 音序器 SysEx 消息处理竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ALSA 音序器 OSS 兼容层在处理 SysEx 系统专属消息时存在竞争条件漏洞。OSS 音序器将 SysEx 消息拆分为 6 字节数据包进行传输，ALSA 音序器 OSS 层在重组这些数据包时未对内部缓冲区的访问进行充分同步，导致多个并发操作可同时访问同一缓冲区，引发越界内存访问。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 SysEx 消息序列触发竞争条件，利用该漏洞读取敏感内核内存信息或导致系统崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 ALSA OSS 兼容层的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。Linux 内核社区已通过引入互斥锁序列化 SysEx 消息处理流程修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57893"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.70、6.1.123 或更高版本（含回补修复的 LTS 分支）。SLES 15 SP3 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0517-1 补丁，SLES 15 SP5 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0577-1 补丁，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7381-1 内核更新。如暂无法升级，可通过禁用 OSS sequencer 模块（modprobe -r snd-seq-oss）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0179488ca992d79908b8e26b9213f1554fc5bacc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d382112b36382aa65aad765f189ebde9926c101","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cff1de87ed14fc0f2332213d2367100e7ad0753a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2392b79d8af3714ea8878b71c66dc49d3110f44","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57893.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57893.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57893.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57893","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57893.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57893.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57893-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57893.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57893.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-pr7g-498h-frwf/GHSA-pr7g-498h-frwf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0619","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57892","title":"Linux Kernel ocfs2 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 OCFS2 文件系统存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，当挂载 OCFS2 文件系统后以只读方式重新挂载时，dqi_priv 指针被释放但未置空，导致悬垂指针。本地低权限攻击者随后通过 quota_getnextquota 系统调用访问该悬垂指针，触发 slab 内存释放后重用，可能造成系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞影响使用 Linux 内核 OCFS2 文件系统的发行版，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57892"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.290+、5.10.234+、5.15.177+、6.1.125+、6.6.70+、6.12.9+，或应用主线补丁 commit 2d4311924863。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 更新，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级，避免在 OCFS2 文件系统上执行 quota_getnextquota 系统调用，并避免将 OCFS2 挂载点从读写重新挂载为只读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d431192486367eee03cc28d0b53b97dafcb8e63","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2e3d203b1adede46bbba049e497765d67865be18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/58f9e20e2a7602e1dd649a1ec4790077c251cb6c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5f3fd772d152229d94602bca243fbb658068a597","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ff6f635a08c30559ded0c110c7ce03ba7747d11","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba950a02d8d23811aa1120affd3adedcfac6153d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f44e6d70c100614c211703f065cad448050e4a0e","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57892.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57892.json","https://github.com/SEC-bench/SEC-bench-Pro/blob/798fe5865a23d1d1dd1aaee2729abd2faf4899d1/projects/linux/CVE-2024-57892/VERIFIED.txt","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57892.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57892","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57892.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57892-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57892.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xmg9-vq9f-g4cr/GHSA-xmg9-vq9f-g4cr.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57892-ocfs2-fix-slab-use-after-free-due-t-1771409994000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0618","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57890","title":"Linux 内核 RDMA/uverbs 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RDMA/uverbs 子系统中存在整数溢出漏洞，`cmd.wqe_size * cmd.wr_count` 等乘法运算中两个操作数均为用户可控的 u32 值，相乘结果可导致整数回绕，进而传递给 `uverbs_request_next_ptr()` 时引发越界访问。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特制的 RDMA 用户空间请求触发该漏洞，导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响所有使用 Linux 内核的发行版，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57890"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.4.289、5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.124、6.6.70、6.12.9 或更高版本。对于 Debian 系统，执行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image` 安装 DLA-4075 安全更新；对于 Ubuntu 系统，执行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即重启，可临时限制对 RDMA 设备的本地访问权限，通过 `chmod 600 /dev/infiniband/uverbs*` 限制非 root 用户操作，或通过内核模块黑名单 `echo \"blacklist ib_uverbs\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-rdma.conf` 禁用 RDMA uverbs 模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/346db03e9926ab7117ed9bf19665699c037c773c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42a6eb4ed7a9a41ba0b83eb0c7e0225b5fca5608","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3ef4ae713360501182695dd47d6b4f6e1a43eb8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b92667f755749cf10d9ef1088865c555ae83ffb7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c2f961c46ea0e5274c5c320d007c2dd949cf627a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c57721b24bd897338a81a0ca5fff41600f0f1ad1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d0257e089d1bbd35c69b6c97ff73e3690ab149a9","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57890.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57890.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57890.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57890","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57890.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57890-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57890.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57890.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-h3c4-5g8f-wf66/GHSA-h3c4-5g8f-wf66.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-57890"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0618.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0617","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57888","title":"Linux Kernel 工作队列 WQ_MEM_RECLAIM 取消操作告警误报漏洞","description":"Linux 内核工作队列（workqueue）子系统存在不正确的警告检测逻辑缺陷。在提交 746ae46c1113 将 amdgpu 调度器工作队列标记为 WQ_MEM_RECLAIM 后，当从非 WQ_MEM_RECLAIM 上下文调用 cancel_delayed_work_sync() 取消内存回收相关工作项时，check_flush_dependency 会误报依赖冲突警告。该问题本质上是取消操作的安全性与刷新操作的依赖性检查之间的语义混淆——取消正在运行或尚未运行的工作项是安全的，不应触发警告。本地攻击者可通过触发特定 GPU 调度场景利用此缺陷，导致内核日志被大量误报信息淹没，影响系统可用性。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中使用了 amdgpu 驱动的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57888"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含该补丁的版本：对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS，安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7514-1 安全更新（`sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade linux-image-$(uname -r)`）；对于其他发行版，升级内核至 6.12 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过内核启动参数 `workqueue.watchdog_thresh=0` 临时关闭 workqueue 依赖检查告警作为缓解措施，但建议优先完成内核更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1fd2a57dcb4de3cb40844a29c71b5d7b46a84334","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de35994ecd2dd6148ab5a6c5050a1670a04dec77","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ffb231471a407c96e114070bf828cd2378fdf431","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57888.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57888.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57888.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57888","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/vulntest/SSTSTestcases/2025/06/CVE-2024-57888/CVE-2024-57888.yara","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57888.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57888.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57888.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57888.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-5fgm-r8gc-2w6h/GHSA-5fgm-r8gc-2w6h.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0616","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57887","title":"Linux Kernel DRM ADV7511 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 子系统的 adv7511 显示桥接驱动中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。在 adv7533_parse_dt() 函数中，host_node 指针被赋值后即被释放，而后续 adv7533_attach_dsi() 函数仍继续使用该已释放的指针，导致释放后使用。本地攻击者利用此漏洞可造成内核内存损坏，导致系统崩溃或权限提升。攻击者需具备本地低权限访问，无需用户交互即可触发，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞影响使用 Linux 内核且启用 DRM adv7511 驱动的系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57887"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本：长期支持分支升级至 5.10.234、6.1.125、6.6.70 或 6.12.9 及以上版本，主线升级至 6.13 及以上版本。对应发行版用户：Debian 11 安装 linux-5.10.0-34 更新（DLA-4075-1），Debian 12 安装对应内核更新（DSA-5860-1），Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 adv7511 DRM 桥接驱动模块（modprobe -r adv7511）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f49aaf55652580ae63ab83d67211fe6a55d83dc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81adbd3ff21c1182e06aa02c6be0bfd9ea02d8e8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/acec80d9f126cd3fa764bbe3d96bc0cb5cd2b087","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca9d077350fa21897de8bf64cba23b198740aab5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d208571943ffddc438a7ce533d5d0b9219806242","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57887.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57887.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57887.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57887","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57887.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57887.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57887-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57887.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57887-drm-adv7511-fix-use-after-free-in-a-1771409862000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-w7pq-rmwm-c759/GHSA-w7pq-rmwm-c759.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0616.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0615","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57882","title":"Linux Kernel MPTCP 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MPTCP（多路径 TCP）协议实现在计算 TCP 选项长度时存在逻辑缺陷，ADD_ADDR 选项与 DSS 选项未正确互斥，导致 TCP 选项溢出，进而引发 `skb_shared_info` 的 `nr_frags` 字段损坏。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特制的 MPTCP 数据包触发空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13-rc3 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57882"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:08Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本：主线 6.13 及以上、6.12.9、6.6.70、6.1.124 或 5.15.177。对于 Ubuntu 系统，安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7459-1 提供的更新内核包；Debian 用户参考 DLA-4071-1 公告更新。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 MPTCP 内核模块（`echo \"blacklist mptcp\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-mptcp.conf && update-initramfs -u`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09ba95321a269019b5aa8e0c3bc80cf86d91fd18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/53fe947f67c93a5334aed3a7259fcc8a204f8bb6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/88b01048f286bb522f524ad99943ba86797d6514","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cbb26f7d8451fe56ccac802c6db48d16240feebd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb08e6b0ba284e3dcdc9378de26dcb51d90710f5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/01/3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57882.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57882.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57882","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57882.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2024-57882-2025-04-05-2005","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57882.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57882.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2024-57882","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/f894a99789a19f707f8832f27d47c52acf540943/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2024-57882-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/vex/usn/USN-7515-1.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0615.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0610","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57857","title":"Linux Kernel RDMA/siw 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RDMA/siw 子组件中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，由于 siw 设备直接管理指向 net_device 的指针而非依赖关联 ib_device 的网络设备生命周期管理，在 siw_query_port() 调用期间已释放的 net_device 被访问，触发 KASAN 检测到 slab 内存释放后使用异常。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或提升权限，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57857"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.9 或 6.13 及以上版本，该漏洞已在提交 16b87037b488 和 4eafeb4f021c 中修复。对于无法立即升级内核的系统，可通过限制本地用户对 RDMA/siw 模块的访问权限作为临时缓解措施，例如使用 `modprobe.blacklist=siw` 内核参数禁用 siw 模块，或通过 `echo \"blacklist siw\" > /etc/modprobe.d/siw-blacklist.conf` 阻止模块加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/16b87037b48889d21854c8e97aec8a1baf2642b3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4eafeb4f021c50d13f199239d913b37de3c83135","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57857.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57857.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57857.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57857.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57857","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57857.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57857.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57857-rdmasiw-remove-direct-link-to-net-d-1767883223000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-3f5v-6r4g-mx23/GHSA-3f5v-6r4g-mx23.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57857"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0606","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57841","title":"Linux Linux 内核 TCP 连接请求内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 TCP 协议栈的 tcp_conn_request() 函数中存在内存泄漏漏洞。当 inet_csk_reqsk_queue_hash_add() 返回 false 时，函数直接返回而未释放 af_ops->route_req 所分配的路由目标（dst）内存，导致内核内存持续泄漏。具有本地低权限的攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过发送大量特制的 TCP 连接请求触发此内存泄漏路径，长期运行将耗尽系统内存资源，导致拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57841"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:05Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 `dst_release()` 修复的版本（主线内核 ≥ 6.12 或对应发行版已合入该补丁的内核版本）。Ubuntu 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7459-1 安全更新，运行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade linux-image-*` 并重启系统。RHEL/CentOS 用户请升级至 kernel-5.14.0-503.el9 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对系统的交互式访问权限，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2af69905180b3fea12f9c1db374b153a06977021","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f4aa4aa28142d53f8b06585c478476cfe325cfc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d38959677291552d1b0ed2689a540af279b5bf8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b0b190218c78d8aeecfba36ea3a90063b3ede52d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de3f999bf8aee16e9da1c1224191abdc69e97c9d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57841.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57841.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57841.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57841","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57841.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57841.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57841.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57841-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qxf9-65gj-mxj8/GHSA-qxf9-65gj-mxj8.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-57841"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0601","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57802","title":"Linux Kernel netrom 缓冲区访问安全漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Netrom 协议栈中 nr_route_frame 函数未在访问 skb->data 前验证 skb 缓冲区长度，导致通过 IEEE 802.15.4 发送原始消息时触发未初始化内存读取（KMSAN 报告 ax25cmp 中的 uninit-value）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 Netrom 子系统，攻击者需本地低权限访问且无需用户交互，通过发送特制的 IEEE 802.15.4 原始帧触发缓冲区越界读取，导致内核崩溃或拒绝服务（高可用性影响），CVSS 5.5（MEDIUM，AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H），Linux Verification Center 使用 Syzkaller 发现，已通过在 nr_route_frame 中添加 skb->len 校验修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57802"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04Z","remediation":"升级内核至支持netrom安全补丁的版本（如Linux 6.10及以上），或直接应用内核补丁以实现skb->len长度验证。通过编译启动参数`hardlockup_detector.unprivileged_only=1`强制启用内核硬锁进行实时监控，禁用不必要的netrom路由协议模块并配置net.ipv4.ipfrag_max_distinct=0以限制潜在的副作用攻击，定期执行`netstat -an | grep netrom`检查端口安全状态，并同时确保系统已应用最新的LTS安全补丁包以防止此类内核区域的缓冲区访问安全问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ba7f80d98d4965349cfcd258dd78418496c1625","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64e9f54a14f2887be8634fb85cd2f13bec18a184","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/769e36c2119a51070faf58819c58274f57a088db","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78a110332ae268d0b005247c3b9a7d703b875c49","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a4fd163aed2edd967a244499754dec991d8b4c7d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cf6befa7c569787f53440274bbed1405fc07738d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f647d72245aadce30618f4c8fd3803904418dbec","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57802.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57802.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57802","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57802.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57802.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57802.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57802-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57802.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xm36-ph36-7r35/GHSA-xm36-ph36-7r35.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57802"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0601.toml"}]